<description>&lt;p&gt;El Salvador has sent more than 2,000 troops to Haiti to locate four missing Salvadoran personnel after a gang ambush near Port-au-Prince. Haitian gangs carried out a major attack that killed 47 people, prompting condemnation from the UN chief. The Haitian government has postponed the presidential election to July 2027. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNaDNhN2Y4MkIwVl9PQ25vRjJnMkE3YjE2LVFSUjhza0E2cElKZTRlQU9ZZzhiSjJrSmV4T1h5QmRGQkZtd3l3eXNVTGhvVEllQ2FTXzd1VEtVbmYtZDZsWmx6aHZLX0xGdDRoOEh4dU44YURocC13T2xHQ1YxNWdZNTBaeDlVYWhJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE1JY29RNmxnQ2xMMTJ4Yks4MFhSR3hJSkw2NmxyVkdINW0wbDNRMTRGaXhjNEZIQm9lVlFtM2ZiX2tqRExEdU96bWZ4U1VzRlVaemo3dm9FMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxONE1saUhrclFYOURZbmxzcy1JVWhhV3phR0NpZ04zX0NJU0VEWDgtLWF0elBFbS1oaEo0akNGOWFtQTk2YXRVSjY0SGFRT0hTNlYxRGEtaFJjTVM3MWRyaTJYQTVXcXp6R3lNbE0tNmVIRkNyUXpUa2tEUzlyeHpLV3F2Z2U5V0JrcW9JZ2gxT1NvNldCQTB6M2tzRWtQcGVXbTVVMU13?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNaU16RlV4NUtmVGVTS0VWS0JFdkNPd0N0VmVEUU9RVGVLcHFJQ1UwZzQ0VWRKeXpXSlV3emhNM3R5NjVSZ05tNmRVOFJING5Kc25PRWhPS1ZUNGRmU01qcnhzbm9CSFJJWkFITUJjTDBaeVZvdV95VXJ1SGtDMmNfcFk0U3ByelJWSWFGQ2FZbksyZlk?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNWUd2NllFeEVtX3lGV2RyRHlRdlZsY24xWG1GX3RTZ2FhZkp4NUFfdnBxQkxaSjZzU1NyZjdFLWV3akVRYmxVR3VOeTBqMzlDc3V1UkVzVnZ2YVpJeEhXWk1kVy1LTFR5SDV1Z3ZoUmUxa2I5U0h1Ym1zY3EzeUNVOExua2dLc2dSUVZUUTBqcUlPSWswdnpsR0Rn?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/r